              "text": "Termination for Convenience. Notwithstanding Section 4.0, IBM may terminate this Agreement, any Statement of Work or Product Attachment, in whole or in part, for its convenience upon thirty (30) (30) days' prior written notice to MSL. IBM shall not be liable for any termination charge, penalty or other payment by reason of such termination, other than amounts payable to MSL for Products and Parts in accordance with Sections 5.2 and 5.3, and MSL shall refund to IBM any amounts prepaid by IBM for the period after the effective date of termination. MSL shall have no right to terminate this Agreement, any Statement of Work or any Product Attachment for convenience prior to the end of the then current term."
